    {
      "id": "26d450fc-e161-4cbc-b919-acbd5d4038a4",
      "x": 160,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 280,
      "shape": "Note",
      "text": "1. Agree on which format is going to be presented the cards, and the input data as well.\r\n2. Build the business logic needed to build the KPIs that are relevant for decision making. \r\n3. Build the tests ensuring that works just fine. \r\n4. Based on books like Essential Poker Math, please apply the indicators built and return a percentage of chance for each action (if the action is not possible, then that one would return 0. All percentages must sum up for 100%).\r\n5. Build a Raise Bet engine that computes the pond, the chips both player have and the stage of tha game, based on the principles of the book. ",
      "textStyle": {
        "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "bold": false,
        "italic": false,
        "underline": false,
        "color": "#FF1F2937",
        "horizontalAlignment": "Left",
        "verticalAlignment": "Top"
      },
      "fillColor": "#FFDBEAFE",
      "strokeColor": "#FF2563EB",
      "strokeThickness": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "Solid",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "zIndex": 20,
      "bounds": {
        "x": 160,
        "y": 1180,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 280,
        "left": 160,
        "top": 1180,
        "right": 840,
        "bottom": 1460,
        "isEmpty": false,
        "center": {
          "x": 500,
